# Locked Aetherion systems

FIXED design requirements. Not suggestions. Not cleanup targets.

If an unrelated task conflicts: **stop**, say `LOCKED … SYSTEM CONFLICT: …`, explain what would need to change, wait for explicit instruction.

## Boosters (LOCKED)

