- MUST remain stackable (`BoosterItems.MAX_STACK = 64`)
- Do not change names, IDs, materials/models/textures, or intended stats/effects

## Borderlands vials (LOCKED)

- MUST remain stackable
- Do not alter rite/altar behavior unless explicitly requested

