## Shutdown countdown (LOCKED)

`AetherionCore` `ShutdownCountdown`: on `stop` / `restart` (player, console, RCON) always chat-warn **10 → 8 → 6 → 4 → 2** every **2 seconds**, then shut down.

- MUST stay enabled across restarts/deploys
- Do not remove, shorten, or bypass for normal stops
- Emergency only: `stop now` / `stop force` (or restart equivalents) skips the countdown
- Prefer sending `stop` (not raw SIGKILL) so players get the warning

Do not strip this unless Robbi explicitly requests removal.
